Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "smartphone stickers",
  "description": "category description"
}


### Get One Category
DELETE  {{host}}/category/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change Status
PUT  {{host}}/category/2/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}